<title>GREECE: NATIONAL BANK TIRANA BRANCH REOPENS.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK TIRANA BRANCH REOPENS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Bank's branch in Tirana opened again for business on Tuesday April 1 and is on 24 hour surveillance by armed guards, National Bank said.</p>
<p>&quot;Customer deposits and other valuables are secure thanks to state-of-the-art safe deposit facilities in the branch,&quot; the bank said.</p>
<p>The branch is located at Bulevardi Deshmoret e Kombit 72 in Tirana. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
